{
  "chapter.475548C263636219.title": "&dGuhpixel",
  "chapter.475548C263636219.chapter_subtitle": [
    "14. The minigame server of the guhs. /lobby, Nyeg!",
  ],
  "quest.47554813E081AD7B.title": "How Do You Get Here?",
  "quest.47554813E081AD7B.quest_desc": [
    "This chapter comes after &6The Super Compass&r in &dThe Guhmension&r: in the &dMinigames&r tab there, pick the &dGuh Internet Café \"The Slow Connection\"&r.",
    "",
    "In the café guhs are asleep behind old beige computers. Walk through the big screen and you're standing in the lobby of &dGuhpixel&r: the minigame server of the guhs. After that &6/lobby&r, &6/hub&r and &6/l&r work everywhere.",
    "",
    "Play the joke games, earn &6Guhpixel Coins&r (not an item: they are on your name) and buy things for your home with them: the Guhcade, the Guh Office and the Guh Cinema. The &dTravel Agency&r and the &dGuh Parkour&r are simply in the Guhmension. Nothing is locked: every quest ticks itself off as soon as you've done it, even if you did it before. The headings show what logically comes next. Tick this off and get chonking!",
  ],
  "quest.475548FA03A2D79D.title": "On Your Marks...",
  "quest.475548FA03A2D79D.quest_desc": [
    "Make a &dStart Post&r and a &dFinish Post&r. Between them comes the &dGuh Parkour&r: a route past toys and obstacles that your guhs run laps on. Hold the Start Post in your hand and click the pieces in order: 1, 2, 3... and the Finish Post last. Then put the Start Post down (within 32 blocks of all the pieces).",
  ],
  "quest.475548BA39B4753E.title": "Hup, Boing, Oops",
  "quest.475548BA39B4753E.quest_desc": [
    "Build obstacles: the &dGuh Hurdle&r (hup, over you go) and the &dGuh Springboard&r (boing!). There are also the &dCrawl Tunnel&r (your guh travels through it as a bump), the &dSlalom Poles&r, the &dBalance Beam&r (oops, off... and back on) and the &dNibble Table&r: the mandatory pit stop. The slide, the seesaw, the swing and the fluffy tunnel can be part of the route too!",
  ],
  "quest.475548972CFE8071.title": "Go!",
  "quest.475548972CFE8071.quest_desc": [
    "Right-click the Start Post, pick one of your guhs and put it &don the route&r (four fit at once). It trots to the start, uses every piece and then simply starts again, until you take it off. Let a guh run &6a whole lap&r. In the same screen you move pieces earlier or later in the route, or take them out.",
  ],
  "quest.4755481300707161.title": "The Fastest Chonk",
  "quest.4755481300707161.quest_desc": [
    "Put a &dParkour Scoreboard&r within 32 blocks of your Start Post. It shows, per guh, the number of laps and the &6best lap time&r. Which of your guhs is the fastest? (And which one falls off the beam the most, Nyeg?)",
  ],
  "quest.475548C63C272CFB.title": "The Great Guh Parkour",
  "quest.475548C63C272CFB.quest_desc": [
    "Build a route of &6at least eight pieces&r with a Finish Post at the end and let a guh run all of it. A route holds sixteen pieces. After that it has surely earned a nap.",
  ],
}
